<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX EDGES UP TO 1,545.36 POINTS.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX EDGES UP TO 1,545.36 POINTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index firmed 5.62 points to 1,545.36 points on Tuesday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040.</p>
</text>
